---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="The Work" description="Strategic briefs with measurable outcomes.">
  <section class="container section grid gap-8">
    <div class="reveal flex flex-col gap-4">
      <span class="kicker">The Briefs</span>
      <h1 class="serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl">Proof of the why behind the what.</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-[color:var(--muted)] max-w-2xl">
        Each brief shows the problem, the shift, and the result, in plain language.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm text-[color:var(--muted)]">Tip: hover to highlight the insight.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
      <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl border border-[color:var(--line)] bg-[color:var(--bg-elev)] text-sm">
        SIR.com global relaunch with video-first UX
      </div>
      <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl border border-[color:var(--line)] bg-[color:var(--bg-elev)] text-sm">
        MyHome dashboard to make the transaction transparent
      </div>
      <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl border border-[color:var(--line)] bg-[color:var(--bg-elev)] text-sm">
        Bright MLS Workspace for 95,000+ subscribers
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-6">
      <article class="group reveal border border-[color:var(--line)] rounded-2xl p-6 bg-[color:var(--bg-elev)]">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-4">
          <h2 class="serif text-2xl">Global Digital Transformation</h2>
          <span class="tag">Sotheby's</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-6 text-sm">
          <div>
            <p class="kicker">The Tension</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[color:var(--muted)]">
              A list-first site wasn't matching the brand's luxury positioning or global audience.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="relative">
            <p class="kicker">The Insight</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[color:var(--muted)] group-hover:text-[color:var(--text)] transition-colors">
              Shift from transactions to storytelling with a video-first, gallery-led experience.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="kicker">The Outcome</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[color:var(--muted)]">
              A responsive, internationalized experience with 3D and multimedia that set a new
              luxury standard for SIR.com.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="group reveal border border-[color:var(--line)] rounded-2xl p-6 bg-[color:var(--bg-elev)]">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-4">
          <h2 class="serif text-2xl">The "Pizza Tracker"</h2>
          <span class="tag">WFG</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-6 text-sm">
          <div>
            <p class="kicker">The Tension</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[color:var(--muted)]">
              Homebuyers had no clear view of what was happening after the offer was accepted.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="kicker">The Insight</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[color:var(--muted)] group-hover:text-[color:var(--text)] transition-colors">
              Build a "pizza tracker" style MyHome dashboard that shows every milestone.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="kicker">The Outcome</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[color:var(--muted)]">
              Recognized by WFG's CTO as Inman Innovator of the Year for transparency.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="group reveal border border-[color:var(--line)] rounded-2xl p-6 bg-[color:var(--bg-elev)]">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-4">
          <h2 class="serif text-2xl">The Professional Workspace</h2>
          <span class="tag">Bright MLS</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-6 text-sm">
          <div>
            <p class="kicker">The Tension</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[color:var(--muted)]">
              Agents were forced to juggle multiple tools and logins across the MLS workflow.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="kicker">The Insight</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[color:var(--muted)] group-hover:text-[color:var(--text)] transition-colors">
              Consolidate daily tasks into one workspace that agents could actually trust.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="kicker">The Outcome</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[color:var(--muted)]">
              A new Workspace used by 95,000+ Bright MLS subscribers.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="reveal mt-10">
      <span class="kicker">Additional Work</span>
      <p class="mt-3 text-base text-[color:var(--muted)] max-w-3xl">
        Selected projects across real estate technology, marketing, and media:
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-4 grid gap-2 text-sm">
        <li>Led product strategy for Props (acquired by Realtor.com) and Nudge (acquired by WEST).</li>
        <li>Defined home search experience content strategy for Remax.com and Berkshire Hathaway HomeServices.</li>
        <li>Built campaigns for fintech leader Radian to introduce new business lines.</li>
        <li>Repositioned WFG National Title and named its national title technology provider.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
